<search>
  <entry>
    <title>从零开始搭建hexo博客</title>
    <url>/2026/10/11/%E4%BB%8E%E9%9B%B6%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BAhexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>教你如何搭建一个hexo博客，无需服务器、域名。利用github进行搭建。</p>
<span id="more"></span>
<h2 id="环境准备"><a href="#环境准备" class="headerlink" title="环境准备"></a>环境准备</h2><ol>
<li><p>安装 Node.js</p>
</li>
<li><p>安装git</p>
</li>
<li><p>安装hexo命令行工具</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br><span class="line">hexo --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="step1-创建github仓库"><a href="#step1-创建github仓库" class="headerlink" title="step1: 创建github仓库"></a>step1: 创建github仓库</h2><p>登录 GitHub，点击右上角的 “+” → “New repository”，创建一个名为 <code>你的用户名.github.io</code> 的公开仓库。例如我的用户名是 Serein0321，就创建 <code>Serein0321.github.io</code>。</p>
<img src="/2026/10/11/%E4%BB%8E%E9%9B%B6%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BAhexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/15ddaf0b-a7fa-42f6-92b3-99c083b8f103.png" class="" title="创建GitHub仓库截图">
<h2 id="step2-初始化-Hexo-项目"><a href="#step2-初始化-Hexo-项目" class="headerlink" title="step2: 初始化 Hexo 项目"></a>step2: 初始化 Hexo 项目</h2><p>环境准备就绪，现在开始搭建博客。</p>
<h3 id="认识博客项目"><a href="#认识博客项目" class="headerlink" title="认识博客项目"></a>认识博客项目</h3><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">D:\blog\Serein0321.github.io\</span><br><span class="line">├─ _config.yml                  博客整体配置</span><br><span class="line">├─ package.json                 项目依赖清单</span><br><span class="line">├─ package-lock.json            npm 依赖版本记录</span><br><span class="line">├─ scaffolds\                   创建文章和页面时使用的模板</span><br><span class="line">├─ source\                      自己维护的内容</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─ _posts\                   正式文章及各篇文章的同名资源文件夹</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─ _drafts\                  草稿，使用时才会创建</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─ _data\                    自定义模板等文件</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─ images\                   头像等公共图片</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─ tags\                     标签页面</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─ categories\               分类页面</span><br><span class="line">│  └─ about\                    关于页面</span><br><span class="line">├─ themes\</span><br><span class="line">│  └─ next\                     后面安装的 NexT 主题</span><br><span class="line">│     ├─ _config.yml            NexT 主题配置</span><br><span class="line">│     ├─ layout\                页面模板</span><br><span class="line">│     └─ source\                主题自带资源</span><br><span class="line">├─ node_modules\                npm 安装的依赖</span><br><span class="line">├─ public\                      Hexo 生成的网页</span><br><span class="line">└─ .deploy_git\                 部署插件的临时工作目录</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="创建博客项目"><a href="#创建博客项目" class="headerlink" title="创建博客项目"></a>创建博客项目</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># 进入项目目录</span><br><span class="line">cd D:/blog</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 初始化 Hexo 项目</span><br><span class="line">hexo init Serein0321.github.io</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 进入项目目录</span><br><span class="line">cd Serein0321.github.io</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 安装依赖</span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="配置-config-yml"><a href="#配置-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="配置 _config.yml"></a>配置 _config.yml</h3><p>打开项目根目录的 <code>_config.yml</code>，修改以下配置：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># Site</span><br><span class="line">title: Serein0321&#x27;s Blog</span><br><span class="line">subtitle: 技术博客</span><br><span class="line">description: 个人技术博客</span><br><span class="line">author: Serein0321</span><br><span class="line">language: zh-CN</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># Deployment</span><br><span class="line">deploy:</span><br><span class="line">  type: git</span><br><span class="line">  repo: https://github.com/Serein0321/Serein0321.github.io.git</span><br><span class="line">  branch: master</span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line">### 配置 RSS 和搜索</span><br><span class="line">feed:</span><br><span class="line">  type: atom</span><br><span class="line">  path: atom.xml</span><br><span class="line">  limit: 20</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">search:</span><br><span class="line">  path: search.xml</span><br><span class="line">  field: post</span><br><span class="line">  format: html</span><br><span class="line">  limit: 10000</span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line">#配置 Next 主题</span><br><span class="line">theme: next</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="step3-安装和配置-Next-主题"><a href="#step3-安装和配置-Next-主题" class="headerlink" title="step3: 安装和配置 Next 主题"></a>step3: 安装和配置 Next 主题</h2><h3 id="克隆-Next-主题"><a href="#克隆-Next-主题" class="headerlink" title="克隆 Next 主题"></a>克隆 Next 主题</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd Jackisome.github.io</span><br><span class="line">git clone https://github.com/theme-next/hexo-theme-next themes/next</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="配置Next的config-yml"><a href="#配置Next的config-yml" class="headerlink" title="配置Next的config.yml"></a>配置Next的config.yml</h3><p>打开<code>\Serein0321.github.io\themes\next\_config.yml</code>后按照下面的来进行配置。</p>
<figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">#选择布局</span><br><span class="line">scheme: Pisces</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#设置菜单</span><br><span class="line">menu:</span><br><span class="line">  home: / || fa fa-home</span><br><span class="line">  tags: /tags/ || fa fa-tags</span><br><span class="line">  categories: /categories/ || fa fa-th</span><br><span class="line">  archives: /archives/ || fa fa-archive</span><br><span class="line">  about: /about/ || fa fa-user</span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"># 返回顶部 + 阅读百分比</span><br><span class="line">back2top:</span><br><span class="line">  enable: true</span><br><span class="line">  scrollpercent: true</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 阅读进度条</span><br><span class="line">reading_progress:</span><br><span class="line">  enable: true</span><br><span class="line">  position: top</span><br><span class="line">  color: &quot;#37c6c0&quot;</span><br><span class="line">  height: 3px</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 书签</span><br><span class="line">bookmark:</span><br><span class="line">  enable: true</span><br><span class="line">  save: auto</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># GitHub Banner</span><br><span class="line">github_banner:</span><br><span class="line">  enable: true</span><br><span class="line">  permalink: https://github.com/你的用户名</span><br><span class="line">  title: Follow me on GitHub</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 中英文空格自动排版</span><br><span class="line">pangu: true</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 数学公式</span><br><span class="line">math:</span><br><span class="line">  mathjax:</span><br><span class="line">    enable: true</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># Pjax 局部刷新</span><br><span class="line">pjax: false</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 本地搜索</span><br><span class="line">local_search:</span><br><span class="line">  enable: true</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="安装必需插件"><a href="#安装必需插件" class="headerlink" title="安装必需插件"></a>安装必需插件</h3><p>Next 主题的许多功能需要额外安装插件：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># RSS 订阅</span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-feed --save</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 本地搜索</span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-searchdb --save</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 数学公式支持</span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-kramed --save</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#Pjax依赖</span><br><span class="line">cd themes/next</span><br><span class="line">git clone https://github.com/theme-next/theme-next-pjax source/lib/pjax</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="step4-创建标签和分类页面"><a href="#step4-创建标签和分类页面" class="headerlink" title="step4: 创建标签和分类页面"></a>step4: 创建标签和分类页面</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new page tags</span><br><span class="line">hexo new page categories</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>修改生成的 <code>source/tags/index.md</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">title: 标签</span><br><span class="line">type: tags</span><br><span class="line">comments: false</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>同样修改 <code>source/categories/index.md</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">title: 分类</span><br><span class="line">type: categories</span><br><span class="line">comments: false</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="step5-添加评论功能"><a href="#step5-添加评论功能" class="headerlink" title="step5: 添加评论功能"></a>step5: 添加评论功能</h2><p>功能演示：</p>
<img src="/2026/10/11/%E4%BB%8E%E9%9B%B6%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BAhexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/35304038-0304-44ba-9673-3d0e2f819cb9.png" class="" title="评论功能演示">
<h3 id="安装-Utterances-App"><a href="#安装-Utterances-App" class="headerlink" title="安装 Utterances App"></a>安装 Utterances App</h3><p>首先需要为你的 GitHub 仓库安装 Utterances 应用：</p>
<ol>
<li>访问 <a href="https://github.com/apps/utterances">https://github.com/apps/utterances</a></li>
<li>点击 “Install”</li>
<li>选择 “Only select repositories”</li>
<li>选中你的博客仓库（如 <code>Serein0321.github.io</code>）</li>
<li>点击 “Install”</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="配置评论"><a href="#配置评论" class="headerlink" title="配置评论"></a>配置评论</h3><p>在博客目录下创建自定义评论文件：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mkdir -p source/_data</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>创建 <code>source/_data/comments.swig</code> 文件：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;div class=&quot;comments&quot; id=&quot;comments&quot;&gt;</span><br><span class="line">  &lt;script src=&quot;https://utteranc.es/client.js&quot;</span><br><span class="line">        repo=&quot;你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io&quot;</span><br><span class="line">        issue-term=&quot;pathname&quot;</span><br><span class="line">        theme=&quot;github-light&quot;</span><br><span class="line">        crossorigin=&quot;anonymous&quot;</span><br><span class="line">        async&gt;</span><br><span class="line">  &lt;/script&gt;</span><br><span class="line">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>然后在主题配置中启用自定义文件：</p>
<p>编辑 <code>themes/next/_config.yml</code>，找到 <code>custom_file_path</code> 部分，取消注释 <code>postBodyEnd</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">custom_file_path:</span><br><span class="line">  postBodyEnd: source/_data/comments.swig</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="启用文章评论"><a href="#启用文章评论" class="headerlink" title="启用文章评论"></a>启用文章评论</h3><p>在每篇文章的 Front-matter 中添加 <code>comments: true</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">title: 你的文章标题</span><br><span class="line">comments: true</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="step6-添加头像"><a href="#step6-添加头像" class="headerlink" title="step6: 添加头像"></a>step6: 添加头像</h2><p>功能演示：</p>
<img src="/2026/10/11/%E4%BB%8E%E9%9B%B6%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BAhexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/554e027f-406e-4440-b202-607116f307b6.png" class="" title="头像功能演示">
<p>将头像图片放入 <code>themes/next/source/images/avatar.png</code>，然后在配置<code>\Serein0321.github.io\themes\next\_config.yml</code>中添加：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">avatar:</span><br><span class="line">  url: /images/avatar.png</span><br><span class="line">  rounded: true</span><br><span class="line">  rotated: true</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="step7-部署到github"><a href="#step7-部署到github" class="headerlink" title="step7: 部署到github"></a>step7: 部署到github</h2><h3 id="安装部署插件"><a href="#安装部署插件" class="headerlink" title="安装部署插件"></a>安装部署插件</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo<span class="literal">-deployer-git</span> <span class="literal">--save</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>部署插件负责在执行 <code>hexo deploy</code> 时，自动将生成的网页提交并推送到指定仓库。安装插件本身不会上传网页。</p>
<h3 id="上传github"><a href="#上传github" class="headerlink" title="上传github"></a>上传github</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo generate &amp;&amp; hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="使用教程"><a href="#使用教程" class="headerlink" title="使用教程"></a>使用教程</h2><h3 id="先设置新建文章的默认模板"><a href="#先设置新建文章的默认模板" class="headerlink" title="先设置新建文章的默认模板"></a>先设置新建文章的默认模板</h3><p>执行 <code>hexo new &quot;文章标题&quot;</code> 时，Hexo 会读取 <code>scaffolds\post.md</code>，根据它创建新文章。希望每篇文章自动带上评论开关、分类、标签和正文结构，就修改这个模板。</p>
<p>打开：</p>
<figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">D:\blog\Serein0321.github.io\scaffolds\post.md</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>将文件内容替换为下面的模板，保存：</p>
<figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br><span class="line">title: &#123;&#123; title &#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line">date: &#123;&#123; date &#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line">categories:</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 分类</span><br><span class="line">tags:</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 标签1</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 标签2</span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">comments: true</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">---</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">在这里写摘要</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&lt;!-- more --&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">在这里写内容</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>模板中的字段含义如下：</p>
<div class="table-container">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>内容</th>
<th>新建文章时的作用</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>&#123;&#123; title &#125;&#125;</code></td>
<td>自动替换为 <code>hexo new</code> 命令中填写的标题</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&#123;&#123; date &#125;&#125;</code></td>
<td>自动替换为创建文章的日期和时间</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>categories: []</code></td>
<td>预留分类字段，暂时不分配分类</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>tags: []</code></td>
<td>预留标签字段，暂时不分配标签</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>comments: true</code></td>
<td>默认允许文章显示评论组件；评论服务仍需按第 15 节配置</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>mathjax: false</code></td>
<td>默认不启用这篇文章的公式渲染，需要公式时改成 <code>true</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code></td>
<td>将前面的正文作为首页摘要</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>正文小标题</td>
<td>每篇新文章自动带上写作结构，可以按文章需要修改</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id="常用命令汇总"><a href="#常用命令汇总" class="headerlink" title="常用命令汇总"></a>常用命令汇总</h3><div class="table-container">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>命令</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>hexo new &quot;标题&quot;</code></td>
<td>创建新文章</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hexo generate</code></td>
<td>生成静态文件</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hexo server</code></td>
<td>启动本地服务器</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hexo deploy</code></td>
<td>部署到 GitHub</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hexo clean</code></td>
<td>清理缓存</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id="为每个博客配资源文件夹"><a href="#为每个博客配资源文件夹" class="headerlink" title="为每个博客配资源文件夹"></a>为每个博客配资源文件夹</h3><p>在<strong>博客根配置</strong>中修改已有字段，设置默认文章类型，同时开启每篇文章的资源文件夹：</p>
<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">default_layout:</span> <span class="string">post</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">post_asset_folder:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>这样创建用于存放该文章图片的同名文件夹。在文档里引用图片就用：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% asset_img 首页.png 博客首页截图 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;% asset_img 配置截图.png 配置文件截图 %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="本地浏览"><a href="#本地浏览" class="headerlink" title="本地浏览"></a>本地浏览</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo generate &amp;&amp; hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>技术分享</category>
        <category>网站博客</category>
      </categories>
      <tags>
        <tag>博客</tag>
      </tags>
  </entry>
</search>
